before:
Complete local Java example; the app itself does not execute it:
```java
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        int choice = 2;
        String action = switch (choice) {
            case 1 -> "Read";
            case 2 -> "Write";
            default -> "Help";
        };
        System.out.println(action);
    }
}

```

